  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "For seventeen years, Barcelona paid money to the number two of Spain's referees. Here's what's actually on the record.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "title",
        "heading": "THE NEGREIRA CASE",
        "sub": "Barcelona · 2001 to 2018",
        "pill": "WHAT WE ACTUALLY KNOW",
        "person": "negreira"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "His name is José María Enríquez Negreira, vice-president of the referees' committee.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "negreira",
        "label": "VICE-PRESIDENT, REFEREES' COMMITTEE",
        "mood": "flat"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "From two thousand and one to twenty eighteen, companies linked to him got around seven million euros from the club.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stats",
        "title": "The payments",
        "items": [
          {
            "n": "~€7m",
            "l": "paid to his companies"
          },
          {
            "n": "17",
            "l": "years"
          },
          {
            "n": "2018",
            "l": "last payments"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Barcelona's explanation? The money paid for technical reports and advice on referees.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "Barcelona's side",
        "body": "The club says it paid for technical reports and consulting on refereeing, and denies any wrongdoing."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "In twenty twenty-three, prosecutors charged the club, two former presidents, Negreira and his son.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "versus",
        "title": "Charged in 2023",
        "left": {
          "person": "rosell",
          "label": "Sandro Rosell",
          "value": "EX-PRESIDENT"
        },
        "right": {
          "person": "bartomeu",
          "label": "Josep Maria Bartomeu",
          "value": "EX-PRESIDENT"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A bribery charge was added that autumn. But in May twenty twenty-four, a Barcelona court threw it out.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "timeline",
        "title": "The court case",
        "items": [
          {
            "year": "2023",
            "label": "Charges filed"
          },
          {
            "year": "Sep 23",
            "label": "Bribery added"
          },
          {
            "year": "May 24",
            "label": "Bribery thrown out"
          },
          {
            "year": "2026",
            "label": "Still no verdict"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Why? The referees' committee isn't a public body, so Negreira wasn't a public official.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "BRIBERY DROPPED",
        "color": "white",
        "person": "negreira"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The sports corruption case carries on. No court has ruled that any match was fixed.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "What no court has said",
        "body": "No ruling has found that any referee was paid to change a result. The case is still being investigated."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "LaLiga says it can't touch the table anyway: sporting offences in Spain expire after three years.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "tebas",
        "label": "LALIGA: TOO LATE TO SANCTION",
        "mood": "flat"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "UEFA opened its own file in twenty twenty-three. In October, it confirmed it's reviewing a big pile of documents sent by Real Madrid.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "text",
        "heading": "UEFA",
        "body": "Investigation opened March 2023, never closed. On 1 October 2026 UEFA confirmed it is reviewing documents from Real Madrid. No new proceedings announced."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "And in May, a forensic report said Negreira's dementia is now too advanced for him to stand trial.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "person",
        "person": "negreira",
        "label": "FORENSIC REPORT, MAY 2026",
        "mood": "worried"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Barcelona's president is clear.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "quote",
        "person": "laporta",
        "text": "Barcelona has never bought referees."
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So in November twenty twenty-six: no trial, no verdict, no titles taken. The case is still open.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "stamp",
        "text": "STILL OPEN",
        "color": "yellow"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more, and play Road to Ballon d'Or at knowitball dot co dot uk.",
      "scene": {
        "type": "cta"
      }
    }
  ]
